[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12541.11, "timestamp": "03:29:01", "text": "我告诉你，我将会成为一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12544.229, "timestamp": "03:29:04", "text": "说实话，我身边没什么人，哦，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12546.99, "timestamp": "03:29:06", "text": "我的团队，你们忘了我打造了樱桃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12549.309, "timestamp": "03:29:09", "text": "花朵和楼梯，我们做了所有这些，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12552.55, "timestamp": "03:29:12", "text": "给你武器任务新的不不不什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12555.389, "timestamp": "03:29:15", "text": "如果你的新Quest仍然无法正常工作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12556.63, "timestamp": "03:29:16", "text": "我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12559.189, "timestamp": "03:29:19", "text": "我不会，我不会接受那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12563.389, "timestamp": "03:29:23", "text": "当然不是我，我肯定不是在寻找什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12566.63, "timestamp": "03:29:26", "text": "我保证会把我的钻石给你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12568.99, "timestamp": "03:29:28", "text": "那么，拥有钻石剑的你，应该不会再有钻石剑了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12572.79, "timestamp": "03:29:32", "text": "不，那么你应该可以移除它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12574.51, "timestamp": "03:29:34", "text": "那么你应该能够回答“在哪里”这个问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12577.189, "timestamp": "03:29:37", "text": "你的东西是从哪里拿的？帮帮我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12579.67, "timestamp": "03:29:39", "text": "有点沮丧，因为我错过了太多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12583.11, "timestamp": "03:29:43", "text": "因为我当时……哦，你……呃……你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12586.79, "timestamp": "03:29:46", "text": "你玩游戏并不断进步，尽情玩耍。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12591.309, "timestamp": "03:29:51", "text": "履行你应尽的职责，然后……不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12594.07, "timestamp": "03:29:54", "text": "帮忙？不不不不，真的就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12596.83, "timestamp": "03:29:56", "text": "我做的就是我实际做的。"}]